    <description>[Deprecated] THIS VERSION REQUIRES THE PREVIEW CLOUD INTEGRATION SERVICE. UiPath Integration Service based automation activities for Dropbox. These activities allow you to execute create, retrieve, update, and delete operations on Dropbox objects (including standard and custom objects).</description>
    <copyright>© UiPath</copyright>
    <tags>UiPathActivities Dropbox ITIL ITAutomation Helpdesk</tags>
